# Plugins without a level 2 scenario directory, one per line as
# "name: reason". `cargo xtask bench --check` fails for every other plugin
# in KernDNS's registry that has no bench/plugins/<name>/ directory.
bind: picks the listen addresses; no per-query work
root: sets the base directory for relative paths at setup; no per-query work
debug: only turns off panic recovery; no per-query work
health: an HTTP endpoint outside the DNS path; no per-query work
ready: an HTTP endpoint outside the DNS path; no per-query work
reload: polls the Corefile in the background; no per-query work
sign: signs zone files in the background (at startup and every 5 hours); no per-query work
on: runs commands on startup and shutdown; no per-query work
pprof: an HTTP endpoint outside the DNS path; no per-query work
